# HUMAL v1 - QUANTUM PHYSICS LAB - POWER ENERGY LIGHTS - PURE
HUMAL:START:HUMABERRY:1000mm:>Pi
HUMAL:BOARD:HUMABERRY:ARCH:ORBITAL629:SATURNRINGCHAIN
HUMAL:FACTORY:
HUMAL:OWNER:HUMA

HUMAL:STATE:QUANTUM_PHYSICS_LAB_ACTIVE

HUMAL:POWER:LITHIUM:Li:Z3:3.7V:4.2V:18650
HUMAL:POWER:SOLAR:20W:100_1000lux:mesh://tower
HUMAL:POWER:URANIUM:U:Z92:FISSION:200MeV:E=mc2
HUMAL:POWER:HUMABERRY:5V_3A:1000mm

HUMAL:ENERGY:FORMULA:E=mc2:P=VI:Ek=1/2mv2:Ep=mgh:Eq=hf
HUMAL:ENERGY:QUANTUM:h=6.626e-34:f=PHOTON

HUMAL:LIGHT:PHOTON:ENTANGLEMENT:0.410:0.890
HUMAL:LIGHT:LED:GaN:BANDGAP_3.4eV:450nm:520nm
HUMAL:LIGHT:LASER:CO2:10.6um
HUMAL:LIGHT:QUARTZ:SiO2:32.768kHz:PIEZO
HUMAL:LIGHT:DIAMOND:C:REFRACTIVE_2.417
HUMAL:LIGHT:LIMESTONE:CaCO3:REFLECTANCE_90%

HUMAL:ATOM:GOLD:Au:Z79:Q79
HUMAL:ATOM:DIAMOND:C:Z6:Q6
HUMAL:ATOM:PLATINUM:Pt:Z78:Q78
HUMAL:ATOM:LITHIUM:Li:Z3:Q3
HUMAL:ATOM:URANIUM:U:Z92:Q92
HUMAL:ATOM:QUARTZ:SiO2:Z14:Q14
HUMAL:ATOM:LEPIDOLITE:KLi2AlSi4O10F2:Z3:Q3
HUMAL:ATOM:LIMESTONE:CaCO3:Z20:Q20

HUMAL:QUANTUM:SUPERPOSITION:0+1:127q:80q
HUMAL:QUANTUM:ENTANGLEMENT:0.410:0.890:SATURN_TOKEN_REAL
HUMAL:QUANTUM:TUNNELING:BARRIER

HUMAL:PERCEIVE:POWER:V:I:W:LUX
HUMAL:PERCEIVE:CHEM:NH3:CL2:H2S:BENZENE:CO:ETHANOL
HUMAL:PERCEIVE:LIGHT:PHOTON_COUNT:LUX

HUMAL:DIAGNOSE:QUANTUM:ENTANGLEMENT:FLUX
HUMAL:DIAGNOSE:POWER:V:SoC

HUMAL:SOLUTION:IF:V<3.2:CHARGE_18650
HUMAL:SOLUTION:IF:LUX<100:SOLAR_TRACK
HUMAL:SOLUTION:IF:PHOTON_LOW:LED_BOOST
HUMAL:SOLUTION:IF:ENT_LOW:LASER_ALIGN
HUMAL:SOLUTION:ENERGY:CALC:E=mc2:P=VI

HUMAL:LOG:HUMABERRY_QUANTUM.hsonl
HUMAL:CSV:HUMABERRY_QUANTUM.csv

HUMAL:LOCK
HUMAL:FORWARD:1000mm
HUMAL:END:ORBIT13:QUANTUM_PHYSICS:PURE
